<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="sec pt-[0]!" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap faq-g">
    <div class="side2 rv"><Eyebrow>Questions</Eyebrow><h2 class="d2"><span class="ln"><span style="--i:0">Before</span></span><span class="ln"><span class="gr" style="--i:1">you ask.</span></span></h2><a class="tl" href="#start" data-pilot>Start a free pilot<svg viewBox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M4 10 10 4M5 4h5v5"/></svg></a></div>
    <div>
      <div class="qa"><button aria-expanded="false">Do we need to integrate anything first?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>No. Fill in a one-minute form, we email you a secure upload link, and you send a batch of recordings. Integrations come later, once you decide to roll out.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="qa"><button aria-expanded="false">Can we use our existing QA scorecard?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>Yes. Verdicta is configured to match your QA form, with 20+ parameters, fatal and non-fatal scoring, and the weightage you set.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="qa"><button aria-expanded="false">Where does our call data live?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>Our cloud, your private cloud, or on-premises. Avishkar AI is ISO 27001 certified, and pilot data is used only for your pilot.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="qa"><button aria-expanded="false">Which languages do you support?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>English, Spanish, French, German, Portuguese, Arabic and Mandarin, including calls that switch language mid-conversation.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="qa"><button aria-expanded="false">Do we need both products?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>No. Use Verdicta, Veritune, or both on the same calls and the same dashboard.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="qa"><button aria-expanded="false">How is pricing structured?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>It depends on your monthly call volume, the products you use and where you deploy. We share a proposal after your pilot.</p></div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

